Package: traumapsychosisBayes
Title: Bayesian Meta-Analytic SEM for Childhood Trauma and Psychosis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ricardo", "Twumasi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "40059457+ricardotwumasi@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Bayesian reanalysis of the trauma-to-psychosis mediation
    meta-analyses. Not an installable package; the DESCRIPTION exists so that
    the analysis dependencies are declared in one machine-readable place and
    renv can resolve them. CmdStan is NOT an R package and must be installed
    separately at the pinned version; see bayesian/README.md.
